WEBVTT

00:24:26.542 --> 00:24:30.126
but also coming into a platform 
where we are taking

00:24:30.126 --> 00:24:35.691
that young generation, those scientists, 
those thinkers, those innovators globally

00:24:35.691 --> 00:24:37.931
and providing them with the right platform

00:24:37.931 --> 00:24:40.458
to express their ideas and to feel

00:24:40.458 --> 00:24:44.158
that we are really guiding them 
in that continuum,

00:24:44.158 --> 00:24:45.970
from working on the language,

00:24:45.970 --> 00:24:49.358
because, as you know,
language is not only science.

00:24:50.918 --> 00:24:55.795
When you are not doing well,
you are not only lagging in science,

00:24:55.795 --> 00:24:58.456
you are lagging in science, 
you are lagging in society,

00:24:58.456 --> 00:25:01.106
you are lagging in language, 
are lagging in everything.